flowchart LR
    U[Human Users] --> IDP[Enterprise Identity Provider]
    W[Workloads and Services] --> WI[Workload Identity]
    A[AI Agents] --> AIAM[Agent Identity and Policy]

    IDP --> PDP[Policy Decision Point]
    WI --> PDP
    AIAM --> PDP

    PDP --> PEP[Policy Enforcement Points]
    PEP --> EDGE[Edge and API Gateway]
    PEP --> SVC[Domain Services]
    PEP --> TOOL[Approved Agent Tools]
    PEP --> DATA[Governed Data Stores]

    EDGE --> MESH[Service Mesh and mTLS]
    MESH --> SVC
    SVC --> DATA
    TOOL --> EXT[External Providers]

    VAULT[Secrets and Key Management] --> EDGE
    VAULT --> SVC
    VAULT --> TOOL
    VAULT --> DATA

    EDGE --> AUDIT[Immutable Audit and Security Telemetry]
    SVC --> AUDIT
    TOOL --> AUDIT
    DATA --> AUDIT
    PDP --> AUDIT

    AUDIT --> SIEM[Detection and Response]
    SIEM --> IR[Incident Response]
    IR --> GOV[Security Governance and Risk]
    GOV --> PDP
